OL,3,GNEWSANew Broads boss starts review of
OL,4,Aunpopular tolls
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new boss of the Broads National
OL,7,FPark said she is keen to listen to
OL,8,Fpeople's concerns about the "tricky
OL,9,Fbalance" of charging boaters to help
OL,10,Ffund its work.
OL,12,FThe Broads Authority, which manages the
OL,13,Fnetwork of rivers and lakes in Norfolk
OL,14,Fand Suffolk, imposes an annual toll for
OL,15,Fall vessels which it uses to pay for
OL,16,Fwaterway maintenance.
OL,18,FThis year's fee increase of 2.5% was
OL,19,Fthe lowest in recent years but there
OL,20,Fare concerns that the toll is too much
OL,21,Fand could deter visitors.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
